Getting engaged is an emotional affair.

It is something we dreamt of, since when? And, in every one of those tiny little daydreams, there is always something romantic about the engagement ring!

From stunning solitaire to regal sapphire, the charm and aura of each one of them are unique and mesmerising — like each individual tale, and this time, a romantic one.

Especially, in our Bollywood-obsessed society, people are always on the lookout for who’s dating who or anything to do with celebrities. There is a metaphorical spotlight from the moment someone gets engaged. Here, I am rounding up some of my favorite B-town celebrity [diamond engagement rings](https://sunnydiamonds.com/engagement-rings.html) — out of my love for these blings!

## 2017 — Anushka Sharma

The [Virat-Anushka](https://www.theweddingbrigade.com/blog/photos-videos-virat-anushkas-wedding/) wedding gained so much attention, making it the most celebrated Indian weddings in 2017. Apparently, Virat took almost three months to find the perfect ring for his ladylove and finally found ‘the one’ from an Austrian [jewellery designer](https://sunnydiamonds.com/contact-us) — ‘the design is unimaginably beautiful and reflects surprising elements, every time you see it from different angles’ — says sources.

{{BLOG_BODY_IMAGE_2}}

## 2016 -Asin Thottumkal

South-Indian actress, [Asin](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asin), married the business tycoon and [Micromax](https://www.micromaxinfo.com/) co-founder, [Rahul Sharma](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rahul_Sharma_(businessman)) in 2016.  But, according to the newspaper reports, Rahul went on his knees and proposed his ladylove almost a year before their wedding, with a 20-carat [solitaire](https://sunnydiamonds.com/love-engagement/engagement-rings.html), imported from Belgium. The ring has a monogram of the couple ‘AR’ engraved on it.

{{BLOG_BODY_IMAGE_3}}

## 2015 — Mira Rajput

[Shahid Kapoor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shahid_Kapoor), one of the most desired B-Town bachelors, proposed his sweetheart with a [solitaire ring](https://sunnydiamonds.com/love-engagement/engagement-rings.html), as extravagant as you’d expect. Apparently, the ring was custom-made to match the taste of Mira.

{{BLOG_BODY_IMAGE_4}}

## 2012 — Kareena Kapoor Khan

The internet couldn’t stop buzzing after [Saif Ali Khan](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saif_Ali_Khan) proposed to his belle, [Kareena Kapoor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kareena_Kapoor) Khan. Known for her natural, effortless sophistication, Saif, proposed to her with a large round solitaire diamond on a simple platinum band. What better ring for a sophisticated and poised begam?!

{{BLOG_BODY_IMAGE_5}}

## 2012 — Genelia D’souza

Indian film actor and model, Riteish Deshmukh, proposed to his ladylove, [Genelia D’souza](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genelia_D%27Souza), with a sparkling round [diamond ring](https://sunnydiamonds.com/) on a platinum band, after eight long years of courtship

{{BLOG_BODY_IMAGE_6}}

## 2011 — Lara Dutta

The  Indian tennis player, Mahesh Bhupathi proposed the model turned actor, Lara Dutta in 2010 with a 4-carat [engagement ring](https://sunnydiamonds.com/love-engagement/engagement-rings.html), designed all by himself. She totally fancies her ring and calls it ‘her favorite piece of jewelry’. They got married in 2011.

{{BLOG_BODY_IMAGE_7}}

## 2009 — Shilpa Shetty

Raj Kundra proposed the India’s glamor girl of the 90s, [Shilpa Shetty](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shilpa_Shetty), with a whopping 20-carat round solitaire ring adorning her finger.

{{BLOG_BODY_IMAGE_8}}

## 2007 — Aishwarya Rai Bachchan

The former [Miss World](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aishwarya_Rai_Bachchan) married [Junior Bachchan](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abhishek_Bachchan) in 2007. Their wedding was one of the most talked about events in India since he proposed her with a 53-carat classy and expensive solitaire ring.

